OL,3,GNEWSAMayor hopeful for festive event
OL,4,Adespite rink doubt
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeicester's mayor has said he is
OL,7,F"determined" to ensure a festive
OL,8,Fattraction takes place in Jubilee
OL,9,FSquare this year despite uncertainty
OL,10,Fover the future of the city's Christmas
OL,11,Fice rink.
OL,13,FThe annual ice rink is in doubt after
OL,14,Fthe rink's previous operator pulled out
OL,15,Fof this year's event amid an ongoing
OL,16,Fdispute with Leicester City Council.
OL,18,FSir Peter Soulsby said an ongoing court
OL,19,Fcase meant there was a limit to what he
OL,20,Fcould say publicly.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
